{"status":true,"data":{"id":247,"name":"StashVehicles","slug":"stashvehicles","mod_id":"StashVehicles","shortDescription":"Overrides dropping - stash vehicles","description":"# StashVehicles\r\n\r\nA simple Sons of the Forest mod that prevents vehicles from being dropped.\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n\r\n- Redirects vehicles to inventory instead of dropping them\r\n- Currently works with Knight V and Hang Glider\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n\r\n- Vehicles must be capable of being stored in inventory (via game or another mod)\r\n\r\n## How It Works\r\n\r\nThe mod intercepts drop actions for supported vehicles and forces them to be stashed in inventory instead, preventing accidental loss of valuable vehicles.","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":null,"isNSFW":false,"isApproved":true,"isFeatured":false,"isMultiplayerCompatible":false,"requiresAllPlayers":false,"lastWeekDownloads":21,"downloads":5731,"latestVersion":"1.0.0","latestVersionSize":"","averageRating":0,"reviewsCount":0,"favoritesCount":0,"commentsCount":1,"sourceUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1767666007772_1742657717567_stashvehicles_thumbnail.png","buildGuid":null,"buildShareVersion":null,"numberOfElements":null,"lastReleasedAt":"2025-03-22T15:35:17.710Z","createdAt":"2025-03-22T15:35:17.710Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:30:00.899Z","userId":406,"categoryId":3,"images":[],"user":{"name":"ThirtyTwelve","slug":"thirtytwelve","imageUrl":"","isTrusted":false},"category":{"name":"Quality of Life","slug":"qol"},"versions":[{"id":559,"version":"1.0.0","isLatest":true,"changelog":"First release","downloadUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1767668402228_1742657717718_stashvehicles_1.0.0.zip","extension":"zip","filename":"1742657717718_stashvehicles_1.0.0.zip","createdAt":"2025-03-22T15:35:17.734Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-06T03:00:02.765Z","_count":{"downloads":5731}}],"_count":{"favorites":0}}}